control: A unit of work's end writes back only while the record's adoption stamp is the one it read with the credential, and the process's own write-back leaves the stamp as it is
removes: the end writes back whatever the record's stamp, so an adoption between its read and its write is overwritten by the credential read before it
packages: ./process/connections
tests: TestAnAdoptionBetweenAnEndsReadAndItsWriteDiscardsTheWriteBack
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

